{"title":"신부의 밤 [19세 완전판]","thumbnail":"https://dn-img-page.kakao.com/download/resource?kid=5wD51/hAC1N7RYWz/LIG1KHwTF2ij0qD3VIPAM0&filename=th3","synopsis":"요괴들의 왕이자 이계의 유일한 용 진몽.모든 걸 다 가진 그가 유일하게 갖지 못한 것은 꿈속의 정체 모를 여인.\"내가 빨고 싶은 건 이게 아닌데.\"멋대로 그의 꿈에 나타나 입술을 빼앗고 몸을 겹치고 정을 나눠놓고벌써 보름째 그를 찾아오지 않는 그녀에게 진몽은 목이 탄다.그런데 하얀 눈이 내리던 어느 밤, 드디어 찾았다.지독히 불행하여 바라는 것이 없는 여자, 하늘과그녀에게 모든 것을 내어주려고 하는 남자, 진몽의운명적이고 치명적인 이야기.","topComments":[],"commentKeywords":[],"rankSeries":{"daily":[{"date":"2026-08-09","rank":209,"change":{"type":"new","amount":null}},{"date":"2026-08-10","rank":178,"change":{"type":"up","amount":31}},{"date":"2026-08-11","rank":192,"change":{"type":"down","amount":14}},{"date":"2026-08-12","rank":147,"change":{"type":"up","amount":45}},{"date":"2026-08-13","rank":217,"change":{"type":"down","amount":70}},{"date":"2026-08-14","rank":205,"change":{"type":"up","amount":12}},{"date":"2026-08-15","rank":218,"change":{"type":"down","amount":13}},{"date":"2026-08-16","rank":220,"change":{"type":"down","amount":2}},{"date":"2026-08-17","rank":217,"change":{"type":"up","amount":3}},{"date":"2026-08-18","rank":180,"change":{"type":"up","amount":37}},{"date":"2026-08-19","rank":206,"change":{"type":"down","amount":26}},{"date":"2026-08-20","rank":214,"change":{"type":"down","amount":8}},{"date":"2026-08-21","rank":229,"change":{"type":"down","amount":15}},{"date":"2026-08-22","rank":218,"change":{"type":"up","amount":11}},{"date":"2026-08-23","rank":201,"change":{"type":"up","amount":17}},{"date":"2026-08-24","rank":212,"change":{"type":"down","amount":11}},{"date":"2026-08-25","rank":164,"change":{"type":"up","amount":48}},{"date":"2026-08-26","rank":203,"change":{"type":"down","amount":39}},{"date":"2026-08-27","rank":217,"change":null},{"date":"2026-08-28","rank":145,"change":{"type":"up","amount":72}},{"date":"2026-08-29","rank":148,"change":{"type":"down","amount":3}},{"date":"2026-08-30","rank":169,"change":{"type":"down","amount":21}},{"date":"2026-08-31","rank":210,"c